  "description": "Five Day Notification for tree works: Carry out tree pruning works to the trees overhanging the public highway. Works to include:\r - Crown lifting to a minimum clearance of 5.0 metres above highway level, to provide safe clearance for vehicular traffic and highway users.\r - Lateral crown reduction of up to approximately 1.5 metres over the carriageway and footway, cutting back to suitable secondary growth points to achieve appropriate clearance and reduce encroachment.\rAll pruning to be undertaken sympathetically, retaining the trees natural form and structural integrity. No topping or excessive crown removal will be carried out.",
